Nexus Industries will host a conference call today at 5:00 PM ET to discuss these results. The call will be webcast live at investors.nexus-industries.com. A replay will be available for 14 days.

### About Nexus Industries

Nexus Industries (NYSE: NEXS) is a global technology and advanced manufacturing company serving the aerospace, energy, digital, and materials markets. Headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona, Nexus employs over 12,500 people worldwide. For more information, visit www.nexus-industries.com.

